

# <type>(<scope>): <subject>          ← at most 72 characters, ASCII
#   type:  feat fix perf refactor test docs build ci chore style revert
#   scope: dsl store overlay panel page slider color pad transition image import adb noop compose
#          catalog embedded samples release deps (optional)
#   subject: imperative, lowercase first word, no trailing period
#
# Body: what changed and why, wrapped at 100 columns. One logical change per commit; it builds and
# passes the unit tests on its own. User-visible? Add a CHANGELOG [Unreleased] line in this commit.
#
# Footers: BREAKING CHANGE: <what to change>   Fixes #<issue>   Co-authored-by: <name> <email>
# Full rules: CONTRIBUTING.md → Commits
